OL,3,GNEWSAParking charges to rise across
OL,4,Acity centre again
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe cost of parking a car in Liverpool
OL,7,Fcity centre is to rise again from next
OL,8,Fmonth, the council has confirmed.
OL,10,FLiverpool City Council said that from 1
OL,11,FNovember the cost of leaving a car for
OL,12,Fhalf an hour within the inner city
OL,13,Fcentre is to go up to #2.40 while an
OL,14,Fhour will increase to #4.60.
OL,16,FThe move, which was signed off by
OL,17,Fmembers on Tuesday, will apply to all
OL,18,Fcouncil-owned car parks and spaces
OL,19,Fthroughout the city centre. Prices last
OL,20,Fincreased in April.
OL,23,APub: 15-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
