OL,3,GNEWSAParking charges to rise across
OL,4,Acity centre again
OL,5,
OL,6,FCouncillor Ruth Bennett said the
OL,7,Fauthority was continually monitoring
OL,8,Ffees and charges so they remained
OL,9,Fcompetitive and sustainable.
